# Allowlist for bin/rulesync-pull.
#
# This repository is public and has no LICENSE, so anything imported from
# ~/.claude ends up redistributed under no grant at all. Third-party skills and
# commands (plugin- or marketplace-installed) must therefore never be copied in;
# they are declared in settingfiles/claude/plugins.tsv and reinstalled from
# upstream instead.
#
# Paths are zsh glob patterns relative to .rulesync/.
rules/**
hooks.json
mcp.json
.aiignore
ignores/**
subagents/planner.md
skills/project-context/**
commands/review-pr.md
commands/fix-pr-comments.md
